sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Case Manager
    participant Agent as Copilot Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant Reason as Reasoning Engine
    participant RAG as RAG Service
    participant API as Case Manager API
    User->>Agent: Request closure explanation
    Agent->>MCP: explain_case_closure(case_id)
    MCP->>API: Verify access and load case context
    API-->>MCP: Authorized case data
    MCP->>Reason: Analyze case context
    Reason->>RAG: Retrieve relevant evidence
    RAG-->>Reason: Ranked passages with source IDs
    Reason-->>MCP: Explanation, evidence, confidence
    MCP-->>Agent: Structured result
    Agent-->>User: Sourced explanation for review
